@startuml t_activity_01_actions_arrows
title Activity Diagram — Actions & Arrows\n(all action forms, colors, stereotypes, list bullets, explicit arrows)

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
    BorderColor #1565C0
    FontSize 11
    ArrowColor #444444
    ArrowFontSize 10
    DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    DiamondBorderColor #F9A825
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #F9A825
}

start

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 1. BASIC ACTION  :text;
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Simple action text;
:Action with **bold** text;
:Action with //italic// text;
:Action with ""monospace"" text;
:Action with --strikethrough-- text;
:Action with <color:red>colored</color> text;
:Action with <b>HTML bold</b>;
:Action with <i>HTML italic</i>;
:Action with <u>HTML underline</u>;
:Action with <s>HTML strikethrough</s>;
:Action with <font color="blue">font color</font>;
:Action with <size:14>larger</size> text;
:Action combining **bold** and //italic// and ""mono"";

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 2. MULTILINE ACTION  :line one\nline two;
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Multiline action
 spanning two lines;

:Three line action
 second line here
 third line here;

:Action with **bold** on first line
 and //italic// on second line
 and ""mono"" on third line;

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 3. COLORED ACTIONS  #color:text;
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

#Red:Red background action;
#Green:Green background action;
#Blue:Blue background action;
#Yellow:Yellow background action;
#LightBlue:Named color action;
#FF8800:Hex color action;
#E8F5E9:Light green background;
#FCE4EC:Light pink background;

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 4. STEREOTYPE SUFFIXES on actions  :text; <<stereo>>
'    SDL stereotypes: input, output, procedure, load, save, continuous, task
'    UML stereotypes: custom
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Receive input data; <<input>>
:Send output data; <<output>>
:Execute procedure; <<procedure>>
:Load configuration; <<load>>
:Save to disk; <<save>>
:Continuous monitoring; <<continuous>>
:Background task; <<task>>
:Custom stereotype; <<myCustomStereo>>
:Multiple words stereo; <<my_stereo>>

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 5. COLOR + STEREOTYPE combined
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

#LightCyan:Read sensor data; <<input>>
#LightYellow:Compute analysis; <<procedure>>
#LightGreen:Write results; <<output>>
#Pink:Error handler; <<task>>

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 6. LIST-STYLE ACTIONS (bullet syntax)
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:List action with items
- First item in list
- Second item in list
- Third item in list;

:Nested list action
* Top level item one
** Sub-item A
** Sub-item B
* Top level item two
** Sub-item C;

:Mixed list
- Step one dash
* Step two star
** Sub-step star-star
- Step three dash;

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 7. EXPLICIT ARROWS  ->  -[#color]->  -[style]->
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Action before explicit arrow;

->

:Action after bare arrow;

-[#red]->

:Action after red arrow;

-[#0000FF]->

:Action after blue hex arrow;

-[#008800,dashed]->

:Action after green dashed arrow;

-[#FF8800,bold]->

:Action after orange bold arrow;

-[#800080,dotted]->

:Action after purple dotted arrow;

-[hidden]->

:Action after hidden arrow;

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 8. EXPLICIT ARROWS WITH LABELS  -> label text;
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

:Action before labeled arrow;

-> plain label text;

:Action after plain labeled arrow;

-> **bold label**;

:Action after bold labeled arrow;

-> label with [condition];

:Action after bracketed label;

-[#red]-> colored labeled arrow;

:Final action;

stop

note right
    **Grammar targets (actions):**
    :text;  basic action
    :multiline\ntext;
    #color:text;
    :text; <<stereotype>>
    #color:text; <<stereotype>>
    - bullet list inside action
    * star bullet
    ** double star
    ->  bare explicit arrow
    -> label;  labeled arrow
    -[#color]->  colored arrow
    -[#color,style]->  styled arrow
    -[hidden]->  hidden arrow
end note

@enduml
